+  <message name="IDS_STS_SETTINGS_OPTION_1_CHOOSE_HOW_RELEVANT_OPEN_TABS_CAN_BE_USED_V3" desc="This string is the subheading of a setting for 'Share relevant tabs in every thread'. This string explains what Redrob shares with Google Search AI Mode when turned on.">
+    Redrob will automatically send the page content and URLs of open tabs that may be relevant to your question to Google to get more personalized responses. Redrob will only share tabs from the window you're working in.
